==Strategy==
A combination of anti-traitless and anti-Dark units can make this stage more doable. Bombercat and Pizza Cat are almost necessary against the Mystery Snowmounds, which are essentially just Razorbacks. Octopus cat or other wave-blockers make the Le'mammoth more managable, preventing it from wiping out your meatshields and letting the Razorbacks reach your heavy-hitters.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], Doge-Packed Garden used to have this stage's name, however, with this stage's addition, the name of the second stage was changed to Snow Falls Forevermore, causing the names for Doge-Packed Garden and Cats Warmly Battling to be shifted to their respective next stages.

